---
title: Scout Discovery Subsystem
---
flowchart LR
    User([User]) --> Chat[Chat or Scout setup]
    Chat --> Understand[DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>semantic interest proposal]
    Understand --> Approval{User approves?}
    Approval -->|yes| Memory[Approved memory facts]
    Approval -->|no| Stop[No write]
    Memory --> Profile[(Scout profile<br/>home · current place · weighted interests)]

    Schedule[Schedule or Look now] --> Sweep[Scout sweep]
    Profile --> Sweep
    Feeds[Configured feeds] --> Sweep
    Memory --> Context[Screened personal context<br/>approved · bounded]
    Context --> Aim[DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>query subject and ranking vector]
    Aim --> Sweep
    Sweep --> Search[MCP web search<br/>Tavily fallback]
    Search --> Candidates[Typed candidate events]
    Candidates --> Rank[Nomic embeddings<br/>deterministic novelty and ranking]
    Rank --> Precision[MiniLM cross-encoder<br/>CPU: orders and attributes]
    Precision --> Reorder[DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>orders the qualified shortlist]
    Context --> Reorder
    Reorder --> Poster[DeepSeek V4.1 vision<br/>captions a selected find's poster]
    Poster --> Describe[DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>bounded descriptions]
    Describe --> Result[Digest and calendar]
    Result --> Reactions[(Tapbacks recorded<br/>per subscriber, owner's own only)]
    Reactions --> Rank
    Reactions --> Aim
    Reactions --> Reorder
    Reactions --> ReadBack([scout_digest<br/>chat read-back])

    classDef interface fill:#f5f5f7,stroke:#86868b,color:#1d1d1f;
    classDef application fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#5e8fc4,color:#102a43;
    classDef data fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#5f9562,color:#183b1b;
    classDef model fill:#f1edff,stroke:#8872c6,color:#2e2450;
    class User,Chat,Approval,Stop,Result,ReadBack interface;
    class Memory,Profile,Context,Reactions data;
    class Schedule,Sweep,Feeds,Search,Candidates,Rank application;
    class Understand,Aim,Precision,Reorder,Poster,Describe model;
